# ==============================================================================
# Tandoor Recipes Per-Stack Environment Secrets (tandoor/.env.example)
#
# Populate SECRET_KEY with a random 50-character cryptographic secret
# (e.g., `base64 /dev/urandom | head -c50`). Global variables from root .env
# are automatically synced into tandoor/.env by 'homelab.sh setup'.
# ==============================================================================
SECRET_KEY=
